sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 用户
    participant Controller as StatisticsController
    participant Service as StatisticsService
    participant StatisticsDao as StatisticsDao
    participant DeliveryDao as DeliveryDao
    participant JobDao as JobDao

    %% 子流程1：平台管理员统计
    Note over User, JobDao: 平台管理员统计
    User->>Controller: 进入"平台统计"页面
    activate Controller
    Controller->>Service: 获取平台数据
    activate Service

    Service->>Service: 统计总用户数
    activate Service
    Service->>StatisticsDao: 统计个人用户数+企业用户数
    activate StatisticsDao
    StatisticsDao-->>Service: 返回用户总数
    deactivate StatisticsDao
    deactivate Service

    Service->>Service: 统计新增用户数 (时间段内)
    activate Service
    Service->>StatisticsDao: 统计新增用户
    activate StatisticsDao
    StatisticsDao-->>Service: 返回新增用户数
    deactivate StatisticsDao
    deactivate Service

    Service->>Service: 统计总职位数
    activate Service
    Service->>JobDao: 统计所有职位
    activate JobDao
    JobDao-->>Service: 职位总数
    deactivate JobDao
    Service-->>Service: 返回职位数
    deactivate Service

    Service->>Service: 统计总投递量
    activate Service
    Service->>DeliveryDao: 统计所有投递记录
    activate DeliveryDao
    DeliveryDao-->>Service: 投递总数
    deactivate DeliveryDao
    Service-->>Service: 返回投递量
    deactivate Service

    %% 子流程2：区域就业数据报表
    Note over User, JobDao: 区域就业数据报表
    User->>Controller: 查看区域就业报表
    Controller->>Service: getRegionalReport(areaCode, dateRange)
    
    Service->>Service: 按区域统计职位分布
    activate Service
    Service->>JobDao: GROUP BY work_city
    activate JobDao
    JobDao-->>Service: 区域职位分布
    deactivate JobDao
    deactivate Service

    Service->>Service: 按区域统计投递分布
    activate Service
    Service->>DeliveryDao: 关联职位区域
    activate DeliveryDao
    DeliveryDao-->>Service: 区域投递分布
    deactivate DeliveryDao
    deactivate Service

    Service->>Service: 生成区域报表数据
    Service-->>Controller: 返回区域报表
    deactivate Service
    Controller-->>User: 展示区域地图/柱状图
    deactivate Controller